      ms: 8800
      voice: 'gemini:Sulafat | a warm, clear Norwegian teacher speaking natural Norwegian Bokmål with an Eastern Norwegian accent; calm and unhurried, never theatrical #ctx:9yszlw'
    female|a||Tilbake til skriptet vi har latt vokse siden forelesning tre.:
      mp3: 
